$$\mathbf{S}_{\text{Ìwà}} = \bigotimes_{i=1}^{N} \sigma_z^{(i)} \quad \text{such that} \quad \mathbf{S}_{\text{Ìwà}} \left\vert{} \Psi_{\text{Eniyan}} \right\rangle = +1 \left\vert{} \Psi_{\text{Eniyan}} \right\rangle$$

